{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32595","headline":"登龙门敬善寺阁 · 刘沧","name":"登龙门敬善寺阁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独步危梯入杳冥，天风潇洒拂檐楹。\n禹门烟树正春色，少室云屏向晚晴。\n花落院深清禁闭，水分川阔绿芜平。\n琐窗朱槛同仙界，半夜缑山有鹤声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32595.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32595","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}